          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Typical assembled weights:</strong> walking pads about 45-75 lb,
            folding home treadmills 150-250 lb, non-folding home treadmills 250-350 lb and
            commercial machines 350-500 lb or more. The box weighs more, and most of the weight
            sits at the motor end.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Heavier usually means more stable and quieter for running, and a sound modern floor
            generally copes. Check the spec sheet for assembled weight, shipping weight and user
            capacity separately, and read our guide on
